/-!
# The Steiner system S(4,7,23) certificate workspace

The 253 blocks below are the candidate heptads of the Witt design
`S(4,7,23)`: the 77 sets `hexad ∪ {22}` over the `S(3,6,22)` blocks of the
`M22` layer, followed by the 176 heptads avoiding the new point `22`.  The
data is generated by `scripts/build_m23.py` from the weight-7 words of the
binary Golay code `[23,12,7]` spanned by the extended hexads; it is not
trusted: Lean checks the finite claims recorded here, including the
block-index certificates for all three generators.
-/

